# Task 5 – Test Permissions

## 1. Try Writing to the Read-Only File

```bash
echo "Testing" >> devops.txt
```

### Expected Result

```text
Permission denied
```

### Observation

The file cannot be modified because write permission was removed.

> This test should be performed as a user that does not have another way to write to the file, such as `root`.

---

## 2. Remove Execute Permission

```bash
chmod -x script.sh
```

### Verify

```bash
ls -l script.sh
```

### Try Running the Script

```bash
./script.sh
```

### Expected Result

```text
Permission denied
```

### Observation

The script cannot be executed directly because execute permission has been removed.

