# Permission Quick Reference

```text
             Owner   Group   Others

rwx          7       7       7
rw-          6       6       -
r-x          5       5       5
r--          4       4       4
---          0       0       0
```

Common examples:

```text
755 → rwx r-x r-x
644 → rw- r-- r--
640 → rw- r-- ---
600 → rw- --- ---
```

